  data:  # 603e
    kind: work_item  # 603e
    title: "JavaScript anonymous callbacks carry an @column suffix in the id's name slot that Symbol.name lacks"  # 603e
    status: todo_hard  # 603e
    priority: 3  # 603e
    parent:  # 603e
    tags:  # 603e
    - id_format  # 603e
    - javascript  # 603e
    isbefore: []  # 603e
    duplicate_of: []  # 603e
    not_duplicate_of: []  # 603e
    pr_ref:  # 603e
    description: "WHAT. js_ts.py gives an anonymous callback the name _cb_forEach and the id name slot _cb_forEach@33, so two same-callee callbacks on one line get distinct ids. ADR-0036 Ruling 1 says the name slot is the sanitized name.\n\nMEASURED (validation_report.name_slot_stats, added in PR #2198): knex 6,356 of 10,649 javascript nodes; 6,604 across six maps.\n\nDECISION NEEDED (owner). Either Ruling 1 allows a disambiguating suffix, or the collision is solved another way. Changing the NAME to match moves stable ids (the name feeds make_typed_stable_id); dropping the suffix makes same-line ids collide. A comment at that site says the validator 'only requires non-empty + colon-free', which is out of date. Found during PR 1 of the stable-id plan, 2026-11-15 (PR #2198). Detail: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/pr1/STATUS.md."  # 603e
    fields: {}  # 603e
- op: discuss  # 7ce5
  at: '2026-11-23T22:18:07Z'  # 7ce5
  by: agent  # 7ce5
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 7ce5
  clock: 2  # 7ce5
  nonce: 7ce5  # 7ce5
  message: "2026-11-23, after PR #2347: this is now the ONLY declared name-slot hole. A name-slot mismatch is an id_format error for every other producer; KNOWN_NAME_SLOT_HOLES holds (javascript, function) alone and its test lets the table only shrink. Measured on dev 49bc5c6e4: knex 6,356 mismatches of 10,649 javascript nodes checked (as filed); 37,227 over 42 repositories, all of them these callbacks. The same question (two nodes with one name on one line) now has three more instances that have no @column: WI-hugir-kubuk-ripig-fotuv-viviv-komir-kusis-hovil. A ruling here decides both."  # 7ce5
- op: discuss  # 0c5e
  at: '2026-11-23T23:19:29Z'  # 0c5e
  by: agent  # 0c5e
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 0c5e
  clock: 3  # 0c5e
  nonce: 0c5e  # 0c5e
  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-11-23 (in session): \"Bless the @<column> suffix.\" The suffix in the id's name slot stays; ADR-0036 Ruling 1 is to be amended to allow it, and the validator is to accept it as a legal form instead of a declared hole. No JavaScript id moves. Same ruling recorded on WI-hugir-kubuk-ripig-fotuv-viviv-komir-kusis-hovil."  # 0c5e
