  clock: 5  # de08
  nonce: de08  # de08
  message: "Decided and built in PR #2354 (dev 39bef1108): the owner ruled 2026-11-23 \"Bless the @<column> suffix\", so Ruling 1 of ADR-0036 now allows the name slot to end @<start column>, and the JavaScript callback id is ruled grammar. js_ts.py mints it through make_symbol_id(column=); the validator accepts the suffix only when it is the node's start column; KNOWN_NAME_SLOT_HOLES is empty; the stale comment at the site is gone.\nFILED MEASUREMENT RE-RUN on dev 39bef1108 (hypergumbo run on knex, closure/maps/dev/big_knex.json): validation_report.name_slot_stats mismatched 0, column_suffixed 6,356, ids_checked 12,385. As filed: 6,356 mismatched. Over 49 trees (bump/totals_run1.txt): mismatches 37,229 to 0, 37,231 ids carry the suffix.\nStable ids of these callbacks did not move for this change (Symbol.name is unchanged).\nEvidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/v19_11232026/closure/ (out_dev.txt = dev 39bef1108 after the merge, out_base.txt = dev 05ed6f5fe before it; repro trees t/, run.sh, q.py, presplit.py)."  # de08
